# Concept Layer — Cross-Reference (Era 1 V2)

For each `T#` in `00-topics.docs`: what already exists in this repo (concept-level narrative,
task guide, CLI reference), and the resulting classification. Checked against the actual
current file tree and `/features/docs/inventory/doc_status.csv` (post Phase 1+2
re-verification, 2026-09-17 — 53/54 CLI groups documented) at the time this version was
executed, not against memory of an earlier state.

Classification legend: **new-page** (nothing today explains this at concept level) ·
**merge-into-`<file>`** (existing narrative already covers most of this, extend rather than
fork) · **deferred-`<reason>`** (resolved later, not now).

| T# | Topic | Existing concept coverage | Existing task-guide coverage | Existing CLI reference | Classification |
