## Validate

- Every T1–T34 has exactly one classification. None left blank.
- Every `merge-into-<file>` row (T2, T3, T6, T11) names the specific existing file(s) and the
  specific gap still open, not just "it exists."
- Checked against the actual current file tree (`ls *.mdx`, `ls guides/*.mdx`,
  `ls infrastructure-setup/*.mdx`, `ls deploying/*.mdx`) and the regenerated
  `/features/docs/inventory/doc_status.csv`, both read fresh for this version — not recalled
  from an earlier planning pass.

## Done when

Complete: 34/34 topics classified, 4 merge candidates identified with named gaps, 29 new-page
candidates, 1 classify-first (T34) deferred to Era 11 by design.
